Respect your fellow wiki maintainers. If somebody gets something wrong, like "2 + 2 = 5", go ahead and correct it, but matters of opinion are just that. If you [http://www.navinic.com disagree], put a link in the other person's piece to your rejoinder on a new page (or use the TitleTalk convention).

